  <section id="meeting-journey" class="meeting-journey" aria-labelledby="meeting-journey-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="meeting-journey-title">Milestones</h2></div>
    </div>
    <!-- A spine rather than a row of cards: the meeting is a continuous
         sequence, so the years hang off one line and the gaps between them are
         visible. Every entry is a fact from the meeting record -- the first
         meeting, the first host country on each continent, the two attendance
         peaks, the cancellation and its replacement, and the year lightning
         talks joined the program. -->
    <ol class="meeting-timeline">
      <li class="meeting-timeline-start">
        <span class="meeting-timeline-year">1959</span>
        <div><strong>Allerton Park, Illinois</strong><small>Twelve maize geneticists at the first meeting.</small></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="meeting-timeline-year">2004</span>
        <div><strong>Mexico City, Mexico</strong><small>The first meeting held outside the United States.</small></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="meeting-timeline-year">2008</span>
        <div><strong>Washington, DC</strong><small>The 50th annual meeting.</small></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="meeting-timeline-year">2010</span>
        <div><strong>Riva del Garda, Italy</strong><small>The first meeting in Europe.</small></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="meeting-timeline-year">2014</span>
        <div><strong>Beijing, China</strong><small>The first meeting in Asia.</small></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="meeting-timeline-year">2017</span>
        <div><strong>St. Louis, Missouri</strong><small>The highest in-person attendance on record, 677.</small></div>
      </li>
      <li class="meeting-timeline-break">
        <span class="meeting-timeline-year">2020</span>
        <div><strong>Keauhou Bay, Hawaii &mdash; canceled</strong><small>Replaced by the community&rsquo;s first virtual meeting.</small></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="meeting-timeline-year">2021</span>
        <div><strong>Virtual</strong><small>The highest reported attendance of any meeting, 721.</small></div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="meeting-timeline-year">2024</span>
        <div><strong>Raleigh, North Carolina</strong><small>Lightning talks joined the program.</small></div>
      </li>
      <li class="meeting-timeline-end">
        <span class="meeting-timeline-year">2025</span>
        <div><strong>St. Louis, Missouri</strong><small>The 67th annual meeting.</small></div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="meeting-dashboard" class="meeting-dashboard" aria-labelledby="meeting-dashboard-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
