        <div><h3>Attendance, 2000&ndash;2026</h3></div>
        <div id="meeting-attendance-chart" class="meeting-chart" role="img" aria-label="Line chart of reported Maize Genetics Meeting attendance from 2000 through 2026"><span class="meeting-chart-fallback">Loading attendance history&hellip;</span></div>
      </article>
      <article class="meeting-chart-card">
        <div><h3>Talks, posters, and lightning talks</h3></div>
        <div id="meeting-program-chart" class="meeting-chart" role="img" aria-label="Stacked bar chart of talks, posters, and lightning talks from 2000 through 2026"><span class="meeting-chart-fallback">Loading program history&hellip;</span></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="meeting-overview" class="meeting-overview" aria-labelledby="meeting-overview-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="meeting-overview-title">Metrics</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="meeting-metric-grid">
      <article class="meeting-metric meeting-tone-gold"><div><strong>68</strong><h3>annual meetings</h3><p>From the first gathering in 1959 through Cologne in 2026.</p></div></article>
      <article class="meeting-metric meeting-tone-red"><div><strong>12</strong><h3>first attendees</h3><p>The community&rsquo;s recorded starting point at Allerton Park.</p></div></article>
      <article class="meeting-metric meeting-tone-amber"><div><strong>6</strong><h3>host countries</h3><p>United States, Mexico, Italy, China, France, and Germany.</p></div></article>
      <article class="meeting-metric meeting-tone-brown"><div><strong>721</strong><h3>peak reported attendance</h3><p>The 2021 virtual meeting; the in-person peak was 677 in 2017.</p></div></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="meeting-related" class="mgdb-hub-related" aria-labelledby="meeting-related-title">
